What the floor does to the price of a verdict
====================================================================================
A verdict separating an attack from honest needs (delta*/d'_attack)^2 tokens.
If the verifier's audit shape differs from its calibration shape, it must
separate the attack from a SHIFTED honest null instead: d'_attack - d'_benign.

